  "translation": "Na king bilong Yisrael i tok long Yehoshafat: I stap yet wanpela man long askim ⟨את⟩ Yahwe long ⟨את⟩ em, tasol mi les long em, long wanem em i no save autim tok profet gutpela long mi, tasol samting nogut — Mikaia, pikinini bilong Imla. Na Yehoshafat i tok: King, i no ken tok olsem.",
